      "id": "claim_7e89ea9584e24c02a98af750f37cf3e2",
      "statement": "useAuth implements three auth modes: stored-token authenticate() called with promise pipelining and no await (the returned promise is used immediately as the AuthenticatedApi stub so auth errors surface on first use), VITE_CF_ACCESS_MODE-driven authenticateFromCfAccess with logout via /cdn-cgi/access/logout, and inline login for pages rendered outside the gate; replacing an authenticated stub disposes the old one, and dispose is idempotent so reconnect double-dispose is safe.",
