    {
      "id": "claim_ef666391383c4a949bbbdc2d2fdac7b4",
      "statement": "Frontend error reporting is compile-time gated by VITE_FRONTEND_ERROR_REPORTING=true (otherwise all reporting is a no-op), POSTs bounded reports to same-origin /api/client-errors, throttles to at most 10 reports per surface per 60s window deduplicated by a fingerprint of failure site + exception type + first stack frame (route deliberately excluded so one fault across routes is one issue), and the entire report path is wrapped so observability cannot change application behavior.",
